{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8eab6847-4f0d-8ec3-93f2-669f31d46874",
  "created_at": "2026-01-21T12:33:12-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ileana Pagan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:30:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:30:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Lorraine. My name is Ileana Pagan. I am calling about the, um, the Christmas tree pickup. The Christmas tree pickup."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:30:13-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, Ms. Pagan. What would you like to know about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:30:18-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I put my tree out at the curb. It was a [pause] real tree. And it is still there. Still there, as of this morning. Before I say more, if I am talking too fast, please let me know. I would like to be clear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:30:34-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're fine, you're going at a good pace. So your tree is still out at the curb, and it's a natural tree, not an artificial one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:30:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Natural. No stand, no lights, no ornaments. I took everything off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:30:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. And when did you put it out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:30:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The Sunday after New Year's. So, um, the fourth. I think the fourth. Yes, the fourth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:31:00-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, Sunday the fourth. Generally the tree collection runs for a set stretch in January, and it's picked up on your regular trash day or on a separate schedule, depending on the year. Do you know what your regular trash day is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:31:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thursday. My trash day is Thursday. Tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:31:18-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so tomorrow's Thursday. I'd leave the tree where it is, out by the curb and not blocking the sidewalk, and see if it goes with tomorrow's pickup. If it's still there after tomorrow, give us a call back and we can put in a request for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:31:35-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. And one more thing. The recycling bin. The blue bin. It has a crack in the side, a big crack, and the lid does not close. How do I request a replacement? A replacement."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:31:48-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For the bin, we can put in a request for a replacement. I'll need to take your name and the address where the bin is. Can I have that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:31:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I would rather not, um, give the address today. I only wanted to know how it works. How the request works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:32:07-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. So you'd call this office, or a staff member will take the request, and we need the service address and a contact number so the crew knows where to deliver it. Then the new bin is dropped off at the property. It's not something you'd have to pick up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:32:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. So the address, and a phone number. And then they bring it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:32:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Address and phone, and the bin gets brought to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:32:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Is there a form? Or is it only by phone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:32:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can do it by phone with us. Just call back when you're ready with the address and we'll take it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:32:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I will call back. Thank you, Lorraine. You were very clear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:32:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Pagan. Just to repeat it, leave the tree out for tomorrow, and call back if it's still there. And call anytime for the bin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:33:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Tree out tomorrow. Call back if it stays. Thank you. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:33:10-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodbye, take care."
    }
  ],
